</span></th>
<th id="S6.T5.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S6.T5.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
