</span></td>
<td id="S6.T5.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S6.T5.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
