</span></td>
<td id="S6.T5.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S6.T5.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="S6.T5.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The improved prompt uses stronger language by emphasizing ’must’ instead of ’to’, which conveys a sense of urgency and necessity, reinforcing the command to perform the target action.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S6.T5.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
